molality = moles of solute / mass of solvent (in kg)
0.129 mol/kg = moles of unknown solute / 0.050 kg
Moles of unknown solute = 0.129 mol/kg * 0.050 kg = 0.006375 mol

Now, we can find the molecular weight of the unknown solute:
