\[
\frac{12!}{10!2!} \left( \frac{1}{2} \right)^{12} = \frac{12 \times 11}{2 \times 1} \left( \frac{1}{2} \right)^{12} = 66 \left( \frac{1}{2} \right)^{12}
\]
3. 11 heads:
\[
\frac{12!}{11!1!} \left( \frac{1}{2} \right)^{12} = 12 \left( \frac{1}{2} \right)^{12}
