\]  
\[
\sin^{-1} \left( \frac{1.3}{1.6} \right) \approx 0.796
\]  
\[
\lambda_d \approx \frac{1}{1000 \, \mu m} \times 0.796 = 0.796 \, \mu m
\]  

Thus, the decay length is \(\boxed{0.796 \, \mum}\).",fluency,"# Task Description
