- \( c = 3 \times 10^8 \, \text{m s}^{-1} \) is the speed of light  
- \( \lambda \) is the wavelength of the emitted radiation  
- \( T \) is the temperature of the black body in Kelvin  
- \( h \) is Planck's constant  
- \( c \) is the speed of light  
- \( k \) is Boltzmann's constant, \( k = 1.38 \times 10^{-23} \, \text{J K}^{-1} \)  

